Laghusaṃvaratantra (Herukābhidhāna)


Based on Janardan Shastri Pandey (ed.) Śrīherukābhidhānam Cakrasaṃvaratantram with the commentary of Bhavabhaṭṭa,' Sarnath: CIHTS, 2002 (Rare Buddhist Texts Series 26). (Henceforth Sarnath edition)

And edition of Alexis Sanderson in The Śaiva sources of the Buddhist Tantras of Śaṃvara, Handout 2 and 3, Trinity Term, 1998.
Edition based on Baroda MS no.13290
YoSa: Jayadrathayāmala, Ṣaṭaka3, Yoginīsaṃcāraprakaraṇa, Paṭala 9

