athāto rahasyaṃ vakṣye samāsān na tu vistarāt
śrīherukasaṃyogaṃ sarvakāmārthasādhakam //1.1//

uttarād api cottaraṃ ḍākinījālasaṃvaram
rahasye parame ramye sarvātmani sadā sthitaḥ //1.2//

sarvaḍākinīmayaḥ sattvo vajrasattvaḥ paraṃ sukham
asau hi svayambhūr bhagavān vīro ḍākinījālasaṃvaram //1.3//

saṃbhavān nādarūpād viniṣkrāntāḥ samayācāragocarāḥ
durlabhaṃ triṣu lokeṣu ādimadhyāntasaṃsthitam //1.4//

manthamanthānasaṃyogaṃ yathā tathā mantrajāpadhyānādibhir yuktam
yogaṃ caiva vidhijñānaṃ tantre nigāditaṃ śṛṇu //1.5//

madhyamottamaśvāsena gandhodakasahitena tu
kulikāṃ pūjayen nityaṃ kālaviśeṣeṇa tu dūtikāḥ //1.6//

dūtayaḥ sahajāḥ siddhā adhamottamamadhyamāḥ
antargatena manasā kāmasiddhiṃ tu bhāvayet //1.7//

svaretobidubhir buddhān bodhisattvāṃc ca pūjayet
darśanasparśanābhyāṃ ca śravaṇasmareṇa ca //1.8//

mucyate sarvapāpais tu evam eva na saṃśayaḥ
yogitvaṃ paramaṃ puṇyaṃ pavitraṃ pāpanāśanam //1.9//

siddhyate japamantreṇa jāpena dhyāyena ca
samayān pālayen nityaṃ sādhakaḥ susamāhitaḥ //1.10//

bhedena samayānāṃ tu na dīkṣāmaṇḍale siddhir avāpyate
madhu raktaṃ sakarpūraṃ raktacandanayojitam //1.11//

gaṇamadhye pratiṣṭhaṃ tu sarvavajrāṅkacihnadhṛk
anāmāṅguṣṭhavakrābhyāṃ lehayed yogavit sadā //1.12//

somapānavad āsvādya siddhim āpnoti śāśvatīm
pañcāmṛtaṃ bhaved atra sarvasiddhipravartakam //1.13//

catuṣpūjā tathā vīrā manasopsitayoginyaḥ
vīrādvayasamāpatti samāpannaṃ ca tattvadhṛk //1.14//

divyamānuṣyatāsaukhyaṃ piṇḍīkṛtya tad eva ca
tad eva vajrakaṇikayā kalāṃ nārghanti ṣoḍaśīm //1.15//



girigahvarakuñjeṣu mahodadhitateṣu vā 
ādisiddhaśmaśāne ca tatra maṇḍalam ālikhet //1.15//

iti herukābhidhāne maṇḍalāvatārapaṭalaḥ prathamaḥ

tatra pānagomayena maṇḍalabhūmi pralepayet
śmaśānabhasmanā yuktaṃ pañcāmṛtasamanvitam //2.1//

upalipya tato bhūmiṃ tatra maṇḍalam ārabhet
śmaśānan tu samācaret ... //2.2//

cityaṅgāracūrṇena śmaśāneṣṭakasaṃyuktam
ālikhen maṇḍalaṃ divyaṃ ācāryaḥ susalakṣaṇaḥ //2.3//

samyagjñānatantrajñaḥ śrīherukamantrajñaḥ
akrodhaś ca śucir dakṣo yogajño jñānapāragaḥ //2.4//

kapālakṛtamūrdhajaḥ ...
bhasmānuliptāṅgaḥ sambhavān mātrair vibhūṣitagātraḥ //2.5//

asthimālāsaṃsthitaś ca ekakhaṇḍīkṛtamūrdhajaḥ
asthimālāvalambī khaṭvāṅgakarasaṃsthitaḥ //2.6//

ātmānaṃ śrīherukaṃ kṛtvā śrīherukatvaṃ tataḥ
smarec cakraṃ asya hṛdi nyaset //2.7//

evaṃ saṃnahya-m-ātmānaṃ prākāraṃ ca diśo nyaset
evaṃ saṃnahya-m-ātmānaṃ adho hy astraṃ viniveśayet //2.8//

cakrasya +sam ātmānam ūrdhvaṃ tu śarajālakam
ātmanaḥ khecaraṃ pañjaraṃ kṛtvātmānaṃ susamāhitaḥ //2.9//

evaṃ saṃnahya sakavaco 'bhedyas tridaśair api
evaṃ surakṣya-m-ātmānaṃ mudrāmantrair alaṅkṛtam //2.10//

ālikhen maṇḍalaṃ ghoraṃ mahāsiddhipradāyakam 
tato mṛtakasūtreṇa mahārudhirarañjitena ca //2.11//

sūtrayen maṇḍalaṃ ghoraṃ herukasya paraṃ puram
ekahastaṃ catur aṣṭaṃ caturasraṃ tu samantataḥ //2.12//

caturdvārasamākīrṇaṃ catustoraṇabhūṣitam
vicared dviguṇaṃ mantrī japed ḍākinījālaśamvaram //2.13//

tasya madhye pratiṣṭhāpya sapatraṃ karṇikojvalam
puṣkaraiś ca keśarānvitam //2.14//

karṇikāyāṃ nyased vīraṃ mahābhiaravabhīṣaṇam
tejaskaṃ tu sudīptāṅgaṃ aṭṭāṭṭahāsamahāravam //2.15//

kapālamālābharaṇaṃ divyaṃ trinetraṃ caturmukham
hasticarmāvaruddhaṃ ca vajrasaṃbhinnasabhruvam //2.16//

khaṭvāṅgakṛtahastaṃ tu śatamālārdhabhūṣitam
tasyāgrataḥ sthitāṃ devīṃ vajravārāhīṃ sughorām //2.17//

śrīherukābhimukāṃ kṛtvā tu trimukhīṃ raudrarūpiṇīm
kapālamantrasaṃpūrṇāṃ sravantīṃ rudhiraṃ mukhāt //2.18//

tarjayantīṃ diśāḥ sarvān sadevāsuramānuṣān
ḍākinyaś ca caturviṃśā vārāhyākulasaṃvarāḥ //2.19//

cakragarbhe tu pūjayet diśāsu vidiśāsu ca
vīrāṃś caiva tathaiveha cakrasaṃsthā pūjayet //2.20//

vīram advayaṃ yad icchet siddhi sādhakaḥ
kalaśāṃś ca tataḥ kuryān mūlakālādivarjitān //2.21//

mauktikair hemaratnaiś ca pravāḍarajatais tāmraiḥ
sarvabhakṣyais tu saṃpūrṇāṃ kapāloparisaṃsthitaḥ //2.22//

sūtreṇa veṣṭayet tatkaṇṭhaṃ pallavāgrasamanvitān
aṣṭau dvāreṣu viniveśya vastrayugmaiḥ suveṣṭitān //2.23//

navamam madhyataḥ kalaśaṃ vastrayugmena veṣṭitam
kṛtvā rajataṃ hiraṇyaṃ vā ratnamaukutiśobhitam //2.24//

vikiren maṇḍale sarvān ratnasauvarṇaśobhanān
pūjayet puravaraṃ ramyaṃ siddhir eva na saṃśayaḥ //2.25//

gandhokena saṃsicyātmānaṃ sarvatomukham
prāg dīpaṃ śataṃ dadyād yad icchet siddhim uttamām //2.26//

ākāśe ḍākinyaḥ sarvā manasā ūrdhvato nyaset
bhūrloke ḍākinyo yāś ca maṇḍale sarvato nyaset //2.27//

pātāle ḍākinyā yā kācit pātāle tajjño vinyaset
diśāsu mātarāḥ sarvā vidiśāsu ca niyojayet //2.28//

puṣpair gandhais tathā dhūpair dīpānāṃ tu śataṃ dadyād yad icchet siddhi sādhakaḥ
pūjayed vīrayoginyaḥ śrīherukasya maṇḍale sthitān //2.29//

dhvajai raktais tathā pītai śvetai<ḥ> kṛṣṇapiṅgalaiḥ
sragdāmair vividhaiś caiva vastrair nānāvidhias tathā //2.30//

vitānaiś ca kāṇḍapaṭṭakais suśobhanais tathā
bhakṣyabhojyakhādyapānai ca kuryāt susamāhitaḥ //2.31//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne cakrapūjāvidhipaṭalo dvitīyaḥ

tata ācāryaṃ toṣayet pūrvaṃ sarvabhāvena sādhakaḥ
yathāśaktyā pūjayed guruṃ siddhikāmaḥ susamāhitaḥ //3.1//

ghaṇṭānādam ālambya puṣpadhūpair alaṅkṛtām
ghaṇṭāṃ vādayet susvarāṃ paṭahikāṃ vāpi sādhakaḥ hāhākāraṃ ca kārayet //3.2//

evaṃ vidhivat saṃpūjya maṇḍalaṃ sarvakāmikam
saṃchādya paṭavastreṇa mukhaṃ teṣāṃ tu putrakān puṣpapūrṇāñjaliṃ prakṣipet //3.3//

pradakṣiṇaṃ ca tataḥ kṛtvā sādhakaḥ susamāhitaḥ
praveśayet tat puravaraṃ ramyaṃ dakiṇāmūrtim āśritya //3.4//

puṣpāñjaliṃ tataḥ kṣipet maṇḍalasyopari
yasmin patati tat puṣpaṃ kulaṃ tatra vinirdiśet śrīherukādipīṭha darśayet //3.5//

tataḥ pūjayen mudrā<m ā>cārya susamāhitaḥ
śiṣyāṇāṃ tu dvitīye ahani raktena trijaptena tilakaṃ tasya kārayet //3.6//

mukhaṃ udghāṭya śiṣyaṃ darśayen maṇḍalaṃ tataḥ
yo yasya devatāsthānaṃ tat tatra tāṃ darśayet //3.7//

samyak praṇipatya tataḥ paścād ācāryasahitaḥ puraṃ
pradakṣiṇaṃ ca punaḥ kṛtvā pratyārambheṇa vāmataḥ //3.8//

maṇḍale gurave ca praṇipatya yathāvidhi
tatas tu gurave dadyāt tathāgatoktadakṣiṇām //3.9//

niryātya suvarṇaśatasahasraṃ ratnāni vividhāni ca
vastrayugmaśataṃ caiva gaja vājī rāṣṭram eva ca //3.10//

karṇābharaṇakaṭakaṃ ca kaṭhikāṅgulikaiś ca samuttamam
yajñopavīta sauvarṇaṃ svabhāryāṃ duhitām api //3.11//

dāsa dāsī<ṃ> bhagnim vāpi praṇipatya nivedayet
ātmānaṃ sarvabhāvena nivedayed buddhimān guroḥ //3.12//

adya prabhṛti dāso 'haṃ samarpita mayā tava
evamvidhais tataḥ kṛtvā sādhakena suniścitaḥ //3.13//

tataḥ tasya tuṣyanti ḍākinyo yogamātarāḥ
ḍākinyo lāmayaś caiva khaṇlḍarohā tu rūpiṇī //3.14//

etair vicarej jagat sarvaṃ ḍākinyaiḥ saha sādhakaḥ
sarvā kiṅkarī tasya sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ //3.15//

yogasiddhir bhaved eṣāṃ trailokyam anivāritam
antardhāanabilottiṣṭhakhecaratvaṃ pādalepo 'tha rasāyanam //3.16//

jāyate tu sadā nityam icchayā sādhakasya tu
rūpāṇy anekāni kurute ākāśena tu gacchati //3.17//

ḍākinī viśeṣataḥ niśumbhayati ca sarvajantūnām
sakṛddṛṣṭena yogena yogitvaṃ jāyate kṣaṇāt //3.18//

adṛṣṭamaṇḍalo yogī yogitvaṃ yaḥ samīhate
hanyate muṣṭinākāśaṃ pibate mṛgatṛṣṇikām //3.19//

eṣa yogavaraḥ śreṣṭhaḥ sarvayogeṣu cottamaḥ
yaḥ kāṅkṣiṣyate kaś cit sa devāsuramānuṣān //3.20//

abhibhūya gamiṣyaty atra maṇḍale yo 'bhiṣiktaḥ
sarvatantroktasādhakaḥ gopya īkṣaṇa pāṇṃ tu āliṅgaṃ dvandvam ādikam //3.21//

abhiṣikto bhavet tatra sarvatantraikam uttaram
tattvasaṃgrahe saṃvare vāpi guhye vā vajrabhairave //3.22//

ayaṃ maṇḍalarājānaṃ na bhūto na bhaviṣyati
uktānuktaṃ ca yat kiṃcit tat sarvaṃ śrīheruke sthitam //3.23//

iti herukābhidhāne dakṣiṇābhiṣekavidhipaṭalas tṛtīyaḥ


tato ḍākinyo bhuvanāni vijṛmbhayanti
mahāvīryā cakravartinī mahābalā suvīrā //4.1//

cakravarmiṇī śauṇḍinī khaḍgarohā cakravegā
khagānanā hayakarṇā subhadrā ca śyāmadevī tathaiva //4.2//

surābhakṣī vāyuvegā tathā mahābhairavā
airāvatī drumacchāyā laṅkeśvarī kharvarī tathā //4.3//

vīramatī mahānāsā prabhāvatī caiva
caṇḍākṣī pracaṇḍā ca etāḥ siddhās tu sādhakaḥ //4.4//

pracaṇḍādiṃ tu vai pūrvaṃ caturviṃśati ḍākinyaḥ
[kāyavākcittamadhye tu yathā bāhye tathātmani]
svanāmoccāraṇamantrāṇāṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭkārāntayojitāḥ //4.5//

dṛṣṭvā yogavaraṃ śreṣṭhaṃ ghuṇam anyat palālavat
oṃkāradīpikāḥ sarvasiddhidaṃ sarvakāmikam //4.6//

vīratvaṃ gatāḥ siddhā gṛhe dṛṣṭvā ca maṇḍalam
tato jñātvā bhāvayen nityaṃ siddhis tathāgatavaco yathā //4.7//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne vīrayoginyādvayaṃ nāma vidhipaṭalaś caturthaḥ.


tataḥ
sarvadharmodaye viśvaṃ karṇike 'nāhataṃ śivam
ālikhed vidhivan mantrī sarvadharmaikasaṃgraham //5.1//
atra mantrapadāni bhavanti 

ālikālisamāṃ kṛtvā vargebhyaḥ pariṇāmitām
catuścaturvijñeyaṃ prastare munisattamaḥ //5.2//

tantrastham uddhared vīraṃ sarvakāmārthasādhakam
caturthasya yaḥ pañcamaḥ pañcamasyāpi pañcamam //5.3//

pañcamasya yaś caturthaṃ prathamasya tu yas tṛtīyam
ekonatriṃśat tathaiva caturthasya yaḥ prathamaḥ //5.4//

antaḥsthānāṃ yaś caturthaṃ tasyaiva yad dvitīyaṃ tu
triṃśamaṃ tu samādāya tathā ṣaḍviṃśam eva ca //5.5//

etat sarvaṃ samuddhṛtya śatārdhārdhaṃ tu tathā punaḥ
trayastriṃśaṃ tato gṛhya prathamasya tu prathamam //5.6//

antaḥsthānāṃ tṛtīyaṃ caiva prathamasya tṛtīyaṃ tu
dvātriṃśam eva caturthasya yaḥ pañcamam //5.7//

pañcamasyāpi yaś caturtham āntasthasya yaḥ prathamam
dvitīyasya yas tṛtīyakaṃ tṛtīyasya yaḥ prathamam //5.8//

pañcamasya pañcamaṃ prathamasya prathamaṃ tu
tathā ekādaś'm caiva ṣoḍaśamaṃ tathā viduḥ //5.9//

tṛtīyasya yaḥ prathamaṃ ṣaḍviṃśatimaṃ tathā 
caturthasya tṛtīyaṃ tu ūṣmāṇāṃ dvayam eva ca //5.10//

prathamasya yaḥ prathama. saptaviṃśatimaṃ tathā
aṣṭāviṃśatimaṃ punaḥ prathamasya tṛtīyaṃ tu //5.11//

pañcamasyāpi caturthakaṃ ekaviṃśat tato gṛhya
tathā pañcadaśaṃ caiva pañcaviṃśatimaṃ tathā //5.12//

prathamasya dvitīyaṃ tu tathā ṣaḍviṃśatimaṃ punaḥ
dvātriṃśad akṣaraṃ caiva ūṣmāṇām antam eva ca //5.13//

dvātriṃśaṃ punaś caiva pañcamasya caturthaṃ ca
dvitīyasya tṛtīyaṃ caiva pañcamasya caturthaṃ ca //5.14//

ūṣmāṇāṃ tṛtīyāṃ caiva saptatriṃśatimaṃ param
antaḥsthānāṃ prathamaṃ caiva tathā ekaviṃśatimaṃ punaḥ //5.15//

antaḥsthānāṃ yad dvitīyaṃ triṃśatimaṃ punas tathā
pañcamasya yaḥ prathamam ūṣmāṇāṃ prathamaṃ caiva //5.16//

tathā dyākāram eva ca caturthasya yaḥ prathamam
ūṣmāṇāṃ tu yaḥ prathamam aṣṭāviṃśatimaṃ tathā //5.17//

prathamasya dvitīyaṃ tu tṛtīyasya prathamocyate
prathamasyāpi yas tṛtīyaṃ caturthasya caturthaṃ tu //5.18//

antaḥsthānāṃ yo dvitīyaṃ tṛtīyasyāpi pañcamam
vyākāraṃ vīram ity āhuḥ prathamasya yaś caturthaṃ tu tathā cāṣṭam eva ca //5.19//

caturthasya yaḥ pañcamaṃ pañcamasyāpi pañcamam
saptaviṃśatimaṃ tathā caturthasya caturthaṃ tu //5.20//

saptaviṃśatimaṃ punaś caiva tathā vai ṣaḍviṃśatim eva ca
pañcaviṃśaṃ samādāya trayastriṃśam eva ca //5.21//

caturthasya caturthaṃ tu pañcmasya pañcamam
caturthasyāpi pañcamam prathamasyāpi prathamaṃ caiva saptaviṃśatimaṃ tathā //5.22//

antaḥsthānāṃ caturthaṃ tu ekaviṃśatimaṃ tathā
ūṣmāṇāṃ dvitīyaṃ caiva tathā ṣaḍviṃśam eva ca //5.23//

