vidyārājasya mantraḥ sarvasādhanavaritaḥ
nātaḥ parataraṃ kiñcit triṣu lokeṣu vidyate //5.25//

jñātvā śrīherukaṃ mantraṃ tyajet sarvaṃ ghuṇam anyat palālavat 
mūlamantraḥ prakīrtitaḥ //5.26//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne mūlamantrasyakṣaroddhāravidhipaṭalaḥ pañcamaḥ


ataḥ paraṃ dvāviṃśatyakṣaraṃ hṛdayaṃ saptākṣaram upahṛdayam
yavargāc cāṣṭamaṃ bījaṃ mātrair dvādaśabhis tathā //6.1//

akṣarāntaritaṃ kṛtvā ṣaḍaṅgaḥ śrīherukocyate
ṣaḍvīrasamāyogair ekaikākṣarasaṃsthitāḥ //6.2//

oṃ namaḥ svāhā vauṣaṭ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭkārasaṃyuktaṃ jñeyaṃ hṛdayāni tu sādhakaḥ //6.3//

prathamaṃ tu hṛdayaṃ caiva dvitīyaṃ tu śiraḥsmṛtam
tṛtīyaṃ tu śikhāṃ dadyāc caturthaṃ kavacaṃ bhavet
pañcamaṃ tu bhaven netraṃ ṣaṣṭhasyāstram ucyate //6.4//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne ṣaḍvīrakavacoddhāravidhipaṭalaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ

tataḥ
svarāṇāṃ trayodaśenaiva dvitīyākṣarayogitam
ekādaśasvarasaṃyuktaṃ ṣaṣṭhamākṣarabhūṣitam //7.1//

svarāṇāṃ caturthenaiva saṃyuktaṃ saptamākṣaram
ekādaśasvarasaṃyuktam aṣṭamaṃ cākṣaraṃ viduḥ //7.2//

navamaṃ tato gṛhyākṣaraṃ dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktam
svarāṇāṃ dvitīyenaiva saṃyuktaṃ dvādaśākṣaram //7.3//

ekaviṃśat tato gṛhya dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktam
caturdaśākṣaraṃ mataṃ viṃśatyakṣarasamāyuktam //7.4//

pañcādaśākṣaraṃ gṛhya tṛtīyasvarayojitam
svarāṇāṃ pañcadaśaṃ caiva śobhanaṃ ṣoḍaśākṣaram //7.5//

tṛtīyasvarasaṃyuktaṃ saptadaṃcamākṣaram
svarāṇāṃ dvitīyenaiva aṣṭādaśākṣarasaṃyuktam //7.6//

ākārasvarasaṃyuktam ekaviṃśatimākṣaram
mātṛkāpañcamena saṃyuktaṃ trayoviṃśatyakṣaram //7.7//

svarāṇāṃ trayodaśamaṃ tena saṃyuktaṃ caturviṃśatyakṣaram
prathamasya prathamaṃ gṛhya saṃyogākṣaraṃ pañcaviṃśatyakṣarasaṃyuktam //7.8//

tṛtīyasya prathamaṃ tu dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktaṃ ṣaḍviṃṣatyakṣaraṃ bhavet
aṣṭāviṃśatimaṃ caiva pañcadaśenārcitam //7.9//

tṛtīyasya prathamena saṃyuktam adhobhāgena vahnisaṃyuktam
tathaiva ca dvitīyasvarayojitam ekonatriṃśatimaṃ cākṣaraṃ bhavet //7.10//

ekatriṃśatamakṣaraṃ dvitīyasvarayojitam
dvātriṃśatyakṣaraṃ trayodaśasvarayojitam //7.11//

bhāskareṇa samāyuktaṃ trayastriṃśatyakṣaraṃ bhavet
mātṛkācaturthenaiva catustriṃśat samāyuktam //7.12//

sarvakāmārthasādhakaṃ mātṛkāpañcamenaiva
saptatriṃśat samāyuktaṃ sādhanaṃ ḍākinīsmṛtam //7.13//

aṣṭatriṃśatimaṃ caiva dvitīyasvarayojitam
sādhanaṃ sarvadevānām evam eva na saṃśayaḥ //7.14//

dvācālīśatimaṃ caiva dahanena tu saṃyuktam
adhobhāgena sādhakaḥ trayaścālīśatim akṣaram //7.15//

svarāṇāṃ pañcamenaiva yojitaṃ pañcālīśatimaṃ caiva
dvitīyasvarayojitam  //7.16//

svarāṇāṃ pañcamenaiva ṣaṭcālīśasamāyuktaṃ sarvavīraprapūjitam
saptacālīśatimaṃ caiva dvitīyasvarayojitam //7.17//

vajrasattvaḥ paramaṃ hi tad ekapañcāśakaṃ tathā caiva
svarāṇāṃ pañcamena tu śobhanaṃ paramaṃ matam //7.18//

dvāpañcāśatimaṃ caiva dvitīyasvarayojitam
sādhanaṃ sarvadevatānām evam eva na saṃśayaḥ //7.19//

tripañcāśas tathā trayodaśasvarayojitam
caturthavargād dakāraṃ samuddhṛtya catuḥpañcāśena yojitam //7.20//

ṣaṭpañcāśadakṣaraṃ ṣaṣṭhasvarayojitam
dhruvaṃ śatrunikṛntanam antaḥsthānāṃ caturthena //7.21//

dvitīyasvarayojitaṃ tathā pañcadaśānvitam
sādhanaṃ sarvasiddhīnāṃ ūnaṣaṣṭi cākṣaraṃ bhavet //7.22//

ekaṣaṣṭimākṣarasaṃyuktaṃ svareṇa dvitīyena tu
evam eva vidur varā dvāṣaṣṭis tathā caiva //7.23//

tṛtīyasvarayojitaṃ ḍākinīnāṃ paramaṃ matam
triṣaṣṭiḥ punaś caiva ekādaśasvarasaṃyuktam //7.24//

śobhanaṃ varṇottamaṃ pañcaṣaṣṭis tathā caiva
vajrasattvena bheditaṃ dvitīyasvarayojitam //7.25//

idaṃ bījaṃ paraṃ divyaṃ siddhidaṃ mokṣadaṃ mahat
ṣaṭṣaṣṭi akṣaraṃ tu tṛtīyasvarayojitam //7.26//

siddhidaṃ sarvakāryeṣu tathāgata idaṃ bravīt
saptaṣaṣtimākṣarasaṃyuktaṃ dvitīyasvarayojitam //7.27//

yoginīnāṃ sarvakāryeṣu evam eva na saṃśayaḥ
aṣṭaṣaṣṭi punaś caiva bakāraṃ tatra yojayet //7.28//

anena bījākṣareṇa adhobhāge prakalpayet
ekasaptatyakṣaraṃ caiva dvitīyasvarayojitam //7.29//

śobhanaṃ sarvavarṇānām evam eva na saṃśayaḥ
catuḥsaptatimaṃ caiva dvitīyasvarayojitam //7.30//

ādisiddhidaṃ tathāgatamukhodgatam
pañcasaptatimaṃ caiva mātrikāṣaṣṭham eva ca //7.31//

eṣa yogavaraḥ śreṣṭhaḥ sarvayogeṣu cottamaḥ
ṣaṭsaptatiṃ caiva mātṛkādvitīyena tu //7.32//

sūryeṇa bhedayec caiva vakāraṃ tatra yojayet
nānyat paramaṃ śobhanaṃ saptasaptatyakṣarasaṃyuktam //7.33//

dhakāraṃ tatra yojayet śobhanaṃ ḍākinīmatam
aṣṭasaptatiṃ caiva dvitīyasvarayojitam //7.34//

etad bījaṃ paraṃ divyaṃ kāraṇaṃ paramaṃ matam
ekāśītyakṣraṃ caiva caturthāntasvarabheditam //7.35//

ādisiddhikaraṃ hy etat sarvasiddhipravartanam
dvādaśītyakṣaraṃ caiva tathā dvitīyasvarayojitam //7.36//

imaṃ tu paramaṃ divyaṃ mūlamantraṃ vidur varāḥ
ālayaṃ sarvasiddhīnāṃ ḍākinīnāṃ hṛdayamardanam //7.37//

śrīherukadevasya vidyārājapaṭhitasiddhir ayaṃ mantraḥ
oṃkārādi hūṃ 2 phaṭkārāntayojito mūlamantraḥ sarvakāmārthasādhakaḥ //7.38//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne mantroddhāravidhipaṭalaḥ saptamaḥ

tataḥ svam ātmānaṃ sarvavīrasamāyogam
sarvasiddhisamāvahaṃ ḍākinījālasaṃvaram //8.1//

hā svā raṃ va saṃ lā jā nī ki ḍā ṭpha hūṃ hūṃ kaṃ ru ru he he jrava śrī oṃ //8.2//

vidyārājasya hṛdayaṃ na bhūto na bhaviṣyati //8.3//

ṭpha hūṃ 2 ha ha hrīḥ oṃ 
ṭpha hūṃ hreṃ hrīṃ hāṃ oṃ //8.4//

vaṃkārayoṃkāramoṃkārahrīṃkāram eva ca
hūṃkāraphaṭkāraḥ samākhyātaḥ ṣaḍyoginyaḥ prakīrtitāḥ //8.5//

hā svā ye nī ca ro vai jra va oṃ
ḍākinīnāṃ tu mahāvidyā na bhūto na bhaviṣyati //8.6//

pṛthvyāṃ caturo ratnā mantramālā tu cottamā
ḍākinī tu mahāvidyā vidyārājā ca herukam //8.7//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne viparītahṛdayaṣaḍyoginīmantroddhāravidhipaṭalo 'ṣṭamaḥ


athāto mūlamantrasya karmavaraṃ vakṣye yathāvad anupūrvaśaḥ
trailokye yad bhavet kiñcit tat sarvaṃ sādhayet kṣaṇāt //9.1//

sarva[karmāṇi karoti] sarvanāgān sarvadevān sarvayakṣān [sarvagandharvān] sarvayonayaḥ sakṛt smaraṇān mārayati.
meghān trāsayati varṣāpayati nivārayati.
samudrān śoṣayati.
nadīṃ kūlam upanayati.
indraṃ nivārayati.
asya mantralakṣajāpena pṛthivīṃ cālayati.
vṛkṣam āruhya yatrecchati tatra gacchati.
sarvamantrān apaharati sarvasiddhim apaharati.
rucitam ākarṣayati, punar visarjayati.
rūpasahasrāny anekāni krute.
icchayā dṛśyate, icchayā na dṛśyate.
prāsādadrumaśikharādīṃś cūrṇayati
viṣam amṛtaṃ karoti.
amṛtaṃ viṣaṃ karoti.
somaṃ payaḥ karoti.
payaḥ somaṃ karoti.
sarvagandhān apaharati.
yatrecchati tatra saṃkrāmati.
mukhagaruḍo yānasṛṣṭikṛt somasaṃgame strīṇāṃ yaḥ samācarati naraḥ śreṣṭhaḥ.
tatra hastagatā lakṣmīr na ke[na]cit pratihanyate.
evaṃ vidhisamāyuktaṃ sarvasiddhiphalabhāg bhavet.
smaraṇān mārayati.
agnim utpādayati.
pātālaṃ vidārayati *aśaniṃ (em. ed.; asaniṃ) ca pātayati [punar nivārayati].
vidyut smaraṇād utpādayati.
sarvadevapratimāṃ nartāpayati.
yasya siddhir nāmagrahāya sakṛj japtena tatkṣaṇād eva mriyate.
aśeṣāṇāṃ tu bhuvanānāṃ bhoktā bhavati.
icchayā saṃgrahati eṣa bhagavān.
na vjrataṃ na caryā nopavāso vidhīyate
anena kalpopacāreṇa karma kuryād yathepsitam //9.2//

yadi kruddhaḥ sakṛd āvartayati koṭiṃ mārayati.
śāntena vartino jīvāpayati.
śmaśānāṅgāreṇa sakṛj japtena yam āhanati sa tatkṣaṇāt patati.
bhasma parijapya yam āhanati sa tatkṣaṇāt piśācena gṛhyate.
śmaśānāṅgāreṇa phalake bhitau vā rātrau yasya nāma likhati sa mahāgraheṇa gṛhyate.
atimuktakalatayā sakṛjjaptayā yam āhanati sa kṣaṇāt pavanavegenāgacchati.
śarkarayā sakṛj japtayā yaṃ tāḍayati stambhito bhavati.
yatrecchati tatra saṃkrāmati.
guggulaṃ sakṛt parijapya dhūpaṃ prayojayati sa sarvasattvān āve[śa]yati.
hastaṃ sakṛt parijapya mukhaṃ pracchādya kāladaṣṭam utthāpayati.
ḍākinīmurāmdritasya sakṛj japtenodakena stambhayati.
sakṛj japtayā karavīratayā yatrecchati tatra saṃkrāmayati garbham //9.3//

na jñātvā śrīherukaṃ jñānaṃ siddhiṃ tv abhikāṅkṣati
tuṣāṇāṃ kaṇḍayati sa tu mantreṇānena rahitaḥ //9.4//

na ca siddhiṃ na ca saukhyaṃ labhate naraḥ
aviditvā idaṃ mantraṃ yogitvam abhikāṅkṣati //9.5//

vṛthā pariśramaṃ tasya naiva tatphalam āpnuyāt
kāmācāro 'yaṃ mantraḥ sarvasiddhipradāyakam //9.6//

na cakraṃ na tapo dhyānaṃ mantraṃ mudrāṃ ca sādhakaḥ
sugatavarṇitaṃ yaṃ jñātvā khānapānādicarubhojyabhojanam
rasādyāḥ sarvasiddhiś ca prāpnoty eva hi sādhakaḥ //9.7//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne mūlamantrasya karmavidhipaṭalo navamaḥ


atha kāyatrayaṃ vakṣye śrīherukādvayayogataḥ
yena vijñātamātreṇa sidhyante nātra saṃśayaḥ //10.1//

dharmakāyaśarīrāṇāṃ yadā bhavati sādhakaḥ
evaṃ suvicāravatāṃ tadā jñānaṃ pravadāmy aham //10.2//

saṃbhogakāyaśarīrāṇāṃ yadā bhavati sādhakaḥ
tadā samāhitānāṃ ca saṃbhogaṃ pravadāmy aham //10.3//

nirmāṇakāyaśarīrāṇāṃ yadā bhavati sādhakaḥ
tadā cittaikāgryaṃ nirmāṇakāyaṃ pravadāmy aham //10.4//

jñānasaṃbhoganirmāṇaṃ samāpnotīti na saṃśayaḥ
śrīherukasvātmānaṃ siddhyante nātra saṃśayaḥ //10.5//

asya mantrasya hṛdayaṃ vakṣyāmi śṛṇu tvaṃ guhyasādhakaḥ //10.6//

hṛdayajāpena yojanakoṭim utpatati.
gacchatyāgacchati.
rūpasahasrāṇy anekāni kurute.
prāsādadrumabhuvaneṣv āruhya yojanaoṭiṃ ḍākinyā saha gacchati.
ākāśe gatvā punar āgacchati.
icchayā dṛśyate icchayā na dṛśyate
icchayā bālavṛddhayauvanarūpadhārī bhavati.
icchayā gajamahiṣagavayavyāghrasiṃhavalīvardaśaśakamārjāroṣṭrarūpadhārī bhavati.
icchayā mayūrakukkuṭahaṃsacakravākabakolūkaśyenagṛdhrakākarūpadhārī bhavati.
yasyicchati tasyaiva rūpaṃ karoti.
vācam apaharati, śrotram apaharati, dṛṣṭim apaharati, ghrāṇam apaharati, jhvām apaharati.
yasyecchati tasya rudhiram ākarṣayati stambhayati vā //10.7//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne kāyatrayasiddhihṛdayamantrasya karmavidhipaṭalo daśamaḥ

athānyatamaṃ vakṣye sādhakaḥ siddhim āpnuyāt
yena prāśitamātreṇāśu siddhiḥ pravartate //11.1//

yasya puruṣasya sugandhagandhaḥ prasvedo nirgacchati, atyavādī ciraṃnimeṣayati, akrodhanaś ca bhavati, vaktre saurabhyaniśvāsaṃ bhavati, sa saptajanma mānuṣajāto bhavati.
taṃ bhakṣayitvā tasya hṛdaye rocanā bhavati.
tāṃ gṛhītvā śrīherukasya hṛdayamantreṇa [aṣṭottara]śatajaptena tilakaṃ karoti, ūrdhvam utpatati.
lakṣajāpo 'nuvartanīyaḥ yojanakoṭyo gacchati.
tena prācitamātreṇa trailokyajñānī bhavati.
[yojana]añcāśakoṭīṃ gatvā ahorātreṇāgacchati divyakāyaṃ ca bhavati.
śrīherukasya hṛdayaṃ yo jānāti yān yān kāmān icchati tāṃs tān dadāti. //11.2//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne saptajanmanaḥ lakṣaṇavidhipaṭala ekādaśamaḥ


athopahṛdayamantraṃ vakṣye sarvasiddhiprasādhakam
trailokye yad bhavet kiñcit tat sarvaṃ sādhayet kṣaṇāt //12.1//
phaṭ hūṃ hūṃ ha ha hrīḥ oṃ.
etad hṛdayasyopahṛdayam
asya mantrasya lakṣajāpena trailokyam api kampayati
devadānavayakṣarākṣasanāgagandharvakinnarān ākarṣayati.
nadīsamudrataḍāgādīni śoṣayati stambhayati ca.
yasmin japati tasmin sthāne sarvaḍākinyaḥ sādhakasya kiṅkarībhavanti.
anayodakaṃ parijapyātmano 'kṣiṇī prakṣālayati saptajanmāni jānāti.
gatāyuṣam api mṛtam iva paśyati dīrghāyuṣaṃ sajīvaṃ paśyati.
cakṣur abhimantrya yaṃ paśyati sa stambhito bhavati //12.2//

vīramṛtakapādatalacarma gṛhya manuṣyarudhireṇa piṃṣya golakamadhye srotāñjanaṃ prakṣipya manaḥśilāgorocanākuṅkumarudhireṇa bhāvayet.
cchāyāśuṣkaṃ trilohaveṣṭitaṃ kṛtvā punar adhivāsya puṣyena ca kārayet.
śrīherukasya mukhe prakṣipya vāmahastena mukhaṃ pracchādya bhūyo 'ṣṭaśataṃ japet.
sa tatkṣaṇād antarhito naṣṭacchādo bhavati.
devair api na dṛśyate, kiṃ punaḥ kṣudramānuṣaiḥ.
evaṃ mukhād apanīya dṛśyate.
asmiṃs tantre iyaṃ khecarasiddhigulikā svayaṃ vīreṇa bhāṣitā.
śrīherukasya hṛdayopahṛdayam //12.3//

anena mantreṇa tarjanyagreṇa śiraḥkapālaṃ nirmāṃsopadhiṃ kṛtvā nirmathati, tasya rudhiram ākarṣayati.
avasavyena mathanāt punaḥ praviśati.
abhimantrya śiraḥkapāle muṣṭiprahāro deyaḥ.
yasya nāmnā dadāti tasya śirovedanā bhavati.
mantram anusmṛtya kapālaṃ dugdhena pūrayet, upaśamayati.
gorocanayā parijapya tilakaṃ kuryāt, yaṃ paśyati sa mudrito bhavati.
tarjanīṃ parijapya yaṃ tarjayati sa tatkṣaṇāt patati.
mantram japtvā bhūmiṃ pādena tāḍayati yasya nāmnā tatkṣnāt mriyate, udakam abhimantrya bhūmiṃ siñcayati, punar jīvāpayati.
mantrajaptena tarjanyagreṇa sahasram api tarjayati, sarve draṣṭāraḥ stambhitā bhavanti, vācayā mocayati.
caṇḍālabhasmaśatajaptaṃ kṛtvā yam āhanati sattvam anusmṛtya tasya rūpadharo bhavati.
homāgnibhasmaśatajaptaṃ kṛtvā yam āhanati sa devair api na dṛśyate, udakena saptajaptena hanet, punar dṛśyate.
kapālamudrāsampuṭaṃ baddhvā nirucchvāso japet, kruddho yasya nāmnā sa tatkṣaṇāt unmatto bhavati.
janasahasram api unmattaṃ bhavati.
manasāmocayati
yasya nāmnā śikhāṃ daśābhimantritāṃ kṛtvā badhnīyāt, sarvaḍākinyāgacchanti.
śūnyāyatanaṃ gatvā śatajaptaṃ śikhāṃ badhnīyāt.
akṣiṇy unmīlya tāvaj japed yāvad adṛśyo bhavati.
muktena punar dṛśyate.
śarkaroṭām abhimantrya ūrdhvam adhastād diśāsu vidiśāsu kṣipet, sarvadevāsurayakṣarākṣasagandharvakinnaramahoragāś caiva baddhvā bhavanti.
ḍāinī sarvayogam apaharati.
śayanāsanaśayyāgataṃ strīṃ puruṣaṃ vā dṛṣṭvā śatavārān mantraṃ japet, lagnāpayati.
manasā mokṣaḥ.
śarkaroṭāṃ parijapya nadīṣu prakṣipet, pratikūlaṃ vāhayati.
tenaiva śarkaroṭena ūrmi stambhayati.
manasā mantram āvartayati.
ūrdhve nirīkṣamāṇaḥ sahasraṃ japet, mahāvṛṣṭiṃ nivārayati.
parasinyābhimukhaṃ sahasrajaptaṃ kṛtvā saṃgrāme vā prativiśati.
śastraśatair hanyamānasya vyathā notpadyate.
na ca śastrasahasrair bhidyate.
vajraśarīraṃ bhavati. //12.4//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne upahṛdayasya karmavidhipaṭalo dvādaśamaḥ

atha kavacasya karmedaṃ vakṣye yathāvad anupūrvaśaḥ
trailokye yad bhavet kiñcit tat sarvaṃ yan manasepsitam //13.1//

tatra kavacaṃ jāpamāno 'dhvānaṃ vrajet.
cauravyāghrādibhayaṃ na bhavati.
kavacaṃ jāpamāno rājakulam aṅganādhiṣṭhāne praviśann na dṛśyate vā yad rocate tad gṛhītvā nirgacchati, devair api na dṛśyate.
kavacaṃ japtahastena yaṃ spṛśati sa śūlam iva stambhito bhavati.
tridaśair api na cālyate.
mantraṃ japtvā pādena ahen mokṣaḥ.
svaraktaṃ svareto vā trijaptaṃ tilakaṃ kṛtvā yena saha bhāṣate, yaṃ paśyati, ye ca taṃ paśyanti, sarveṣāṃ rudhiram ākarṣayati.
yasya gṛhe krodhāviṣṭaḥ sahasraṃ japet, sarveṣāṃ jvaro bhavati.
udakaṃ pañcajaptaṃ kṣipet, pratyānayanam.
yasya mukhaṃ nirīkṣya japate tasya vācam apaharati.
nadītaḍāgāvasthitaḥ sahasraṃ japet, udakopari vrajet.
yathā sthale tathā jale 'pi gacchati.
udakaṃ praviśya nadyāṃ samudre cāpi tiṣṭhati.
karadvayenodvartamāno sahasraṃ japet, yoginīvaśyā bhavanti. //13.2//

yoginīś caiva nānārūpiṇyo ḍākinīlāmayas tathā
khaṇḍarohārūpiṇya ityādyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ //13.3//

sarve tasya vaśyānugā bhavanti.
puṣpayogena paṭaṃ kṛtvā tena prāvṛtaśarīro yoginīsamāpanno daśasahasrāṇi japet, tataḥ siddho bhavati.
tena prāvṛtaśarīro yojanasahasram ākāśe 'dṛśyo bhavati.
yatrecchati tatra gacchati, tena pṛthivīṃ samudrāntāṃ paryaṭati, ūrdhvasrotago vā gāchati //13.4//

yad yad indriyamārgatvaṃ yāyāt tat tat svabhāvataḥ
paramāhitayogena sarvaṃ buddhamayaṃ vahet //13.5//

pārijātayūṣaṃ kare saṃgṛhya sahasraṃ japtaṃ kṛtvā yasya tilakaṃ karoti, sa vṛkṣo bhavati.
udakena saptajaptena siñcayet pratyānayanam etat.
hastipādatalasthāṃ dhūliṃ gṛhya sahasraṃ japtaṃ kṛtvā yam āhanati sa hastī bhavati //13.6//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne kavacamantrasya prayogavidhipaṭalaḥ trayodaśamaḥ.

atha [tat] sādhanaṃ vakṣye yena siddhyanti sādhakaḥ
gardabhākārayogātmā manoveganivṛttaye //14.1//

yoginī lāmā rūpiṇī ḍākinī tathā khaṇḍarohā yoginyaḥ kāmarūpiṇyaḥ gardabhākārarudhiravaktrā ca ḍākinyaḥ triśūlakaraveṣṭitā ca sādhitāḥ.
gatāayuṣam api paśyed dīrghāyuṣaṃ ca.
asmiṃs tu sugardabho yogī paśyet.
tadā gardabhaṃ hastinaṃ caiva yaḥ pūrvaṃ taṃ paśyet.
yasya yasya tu yo jātim āvahet pūrvajanmani tasyaiva tadrūpaṃ dṛśyate iha yoginaḥ.
sa bhavet siddhidaḥ puruṣaḥ sa saptajanmāmānuṣaḥ puruṣaḥ.
tena balihoma kartavyaḥ sādhakasya siddhyati //14.2//

tathā yojanānāṃ śatasahasramūrdhvam ākramate kṣaṇāt
eṣa mantravaro yogaḥ śreṣṭho ḍākinīyogasādhakaḥ //14.3//

yoganimitaṃ japed yas tu māsenaikena sidhyati
rahasyam etat tantrasya mantrasya hṛdayaṃ param //14.4//

yo jānāti tattvena sa yogī nātra saṃśayaḥ
eṣa te heruko vīro ḍākinījālasaṃvaram //14.5//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne gardabhākārayogaśrīherukīkaraṇavidhipaṭalaś caturdaśamaḥ

athātaḥ sarvasaṃvareṣu chommāka bhavanti
chommakā ye na jānanti te na siddhyanti na saṃśayaḥ //15.1//
ḍā iti pruṣaḥsmṛtaḥ.
ḍī iti strīṇāṃ tataḥ.
pu iti stambhanam.
su iti bhakṣaṇaṃ caiva.
mā iti mātā tu vai smṛtaḥ.
yo iti bhāryātu vai.
bhī iti bhaginī tathā.
vī iti sakhī prakīrtitaḥ.
lu iti duhitā.
strī iti rudhiraṃ jñeyam.
so ti somapānaṃ tu.
pe iti peyaṃ tathā.
pī iti māṃsaṃ vai.
bha iti bhakṣaṇam.
bhū iti melāpakam.
pī iti tathā śmaśānam.
dū iti mṛtakaṃ viduḥ.
ḍī iti yoginī smṛtā.
ma iti lāmayā tathā.
strī iti rūpiṇī caiva.
kū iti ḍākinī smṛtā.
hā iti khaṇḍarohā vai.
ja iti jaṅghāyugalam.
bha iti abhivādanam.
sva iti svāgatakriyā.
ete ekaikākṣarā chommakā vīrabhaginyas tu tā jñeyāḥ.

iti śrīherukābhidhāne akṣarachomavidhipaṭalaḥ pañcadaśamaḥ.

atha guhyabhaktam abhaktaṃ vai pravakṣyāmīha sādhakaḥ
parasamayasthitā bhaktyā manojñā upakārikā //16.1//

bhaktābhaktaṃ pradātavyaṃ varṇabhedaṃ tu yad guhyam
vīrādvayayoginaḥ yena vijñātamātreṇa sādhakaḥ siddhim āpnujyāt //16.2//

mṛṇālagaurā yā nārī padmapatrāyatalocanā
sitavastrapriyā nityaṃ navacandanagandhinī //16.3//

saugatagoṣṭhīratā caiva sā jñeyā kulagotrajā
yā nārī taptahemābhā raktapītāmbarapriyā //16.4//

jāticampakagandhā ca sā ca rudānugā bhavet
yā ca indīvaraśyāmā nīlāmbaradharapriyā //16.5//

nīlotpalaśubhagandhā ca vīrabhadrānugā hi sā
yā nārī ..... puṇḍarīkadalacchavir //16.6//

mṛṇālagandhā ca satataṃ sā tu vīramatī tathā
raktagaurā ca yā nārī raktavastrā surūpiṇī //16.7//

mallikotpalagandhā ca sā vajrakulasaṃbhavā
pītaśyāmā tu yā nārī śuklāmbaradharapriyā //16.8//

śirīṣapuṣpagandhā ca tathāgatakulānugā
āraktavarṇā ca yā nārī tadvarṇāmbaradhāriṇī //16.9//

karpūragandhā satataṃ vairocanakulānugā
saptaitāni mayoktāni yoginīnāṃ kulāni tu //16.10//

vāmācāraratā nityaṃ hy ete svamudrāvarṇalakṣaṇāḥ 
kulavidyākṣarāṇi ca ṣaḍ varṇāni bhavanti hi
badhnāti hi svakāṃ mudrāṃ vacāṃ vakti svagotrajām //16.11//

vāmena yāti yā nārī yoginyo vāmataḥ sadā
vāmahastaprabhāṣī ca vāmadṛṣṭyāvalokinaḥ //16.12//

strīṇāṃ hṛṣṭaprabhāṣī ca samayī so vidhīyate
yaḥ strīṇāṃ prārthitaṃ kuryāt kulabījaiḥ prabhāṣate //16.13//

kulakriyāṃ na tyajati svaśāstroktaṃ na muñcati
japati svakulāṃ vidyāṃ samayī so vidhīyate //16.14//

namaskāraṃ ca yo baddhvā vāmāṅgapraṇataḥ sadā
strīṇāṃ saṃbhāṣaṇaṃ kuryāt sā bhavet tasyāyattā khalu //16.15//

vāmāṅguṣṭhalikhanyāśu bhūmau saṃlikhate yadā
śiraḥkaṇḍūyanaṃ kuryāt tiryagdṛṣṭir vāmapāṇinā 
svavidyāsmaraṇāt tasya sādhakasya viṣaye hi tā //16.16//

gaṇḍe vā cibuke vāpi nāsikāyāṃ kṛtāṅguliḥ
tiryagdṛṣṭiḥ sakṛn mantraṃ japya vidyāṃ nirīkṣayet
sadbhāvaṃ yānti yoginyaḥ samayinyaś ca yāḥ khalu //16.17//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne saptayoginīlakṣaṇaparīkṣāvidhipaṭalaḥ ṣoḍaśamaḥ.

durlabhā yoginīnāṃ tu ḍāinīnāṃ tathaiva ca 
pañcāmṛtasambhavāt //17.1//

yāminī trāsinī kāminī bhīmā saṃcārā bhāsvarā
ḍākinyaḥ sapta saṃhṛtāḥ svalakṣaṇam ihocyate //17.2//

rūpikā cumbikā lāmā parāvṛttā sabālikā
anivartikā aihikī devī ḍākinyaḥ saptadhā smṛtāḥ //17.3//

aviraktaṃ nrīkṣeta yā bhrūbhaṅgaṃ karoti ca
rūpaṃ saṃharati prāk paścān nyāsaṃ karoti ca //17.4//

rūpikā sā tu vijñeyā vīrādvayaprasevitā 
iṣṭaṃ vā yadi vāniṣṭaṃ śiśum ālabya cumbati //17.5//

cumbikā sā tu vijñeyā ḍākinī aghanāśanī
tiryagdṛṣṭibhṛkuṭīvaktrā bhrūk.epais tarjayanty atha //17.6//

niśvāsair bhairavais teṣāṃ tās tu lāmā vinirdiśet
varāhaśarabhamārjāraśṛgālājāśivāhayāḥ //17.7//

sarvān tāṃs trāsayet trastā parāvṛttā hi sā smṛtā
prahṛṣṭā hasate yā tu gatā bhūyo nivartate //17.8//

anurakte haste spaṣṭaṃ sā mātā khaṇḍarohikā
manodvignā kareṇātha loṣṭhena caraṇena vā //17.9//

paṭāntenātha kāṣṭhena tayā spṛṣṭo na jīvati
anivartīṃ vijānīyād asādhyā sā hi kīrtitā //17.10//

hasati jalpati rudati vā akasmād vā prakupyate
aihikā sā smṛtā devī ...... //17.11//

ḍākinīnāṃ kule mudrā vīrasevī tu lakṣayet
kapālaparśudaṃṣṭrāśukrakaca dhvajakhaḍgāḥ saṃtrāsanī
saṃkhyayā cāṣṭamī smṛtā kulamudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ //17.12//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne sarvayoginīrūpaparivarta<na>cihnamudrāpaṭalaḥ saptadaśamaḥ.

athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi ḍākinīnāṃ paramaṃ padam
yena samyag vijānāti ḍākiṇyaḥ samaye sthitāḥ //18.1//

raktagaurā hi yā nārī padmagandhaṃ vimuñcati
saumyadṛṣṭi<r> prakṛtyaiva saṃraktā darśanānugā //18.2//

nakhā hi yasyā nāryā saṃrakte nayane tathā
gṛhe ca likhitaṃ padmaṃ padmanartteśavarakulodbhavā //18.3//

bhrūmadhyagataṃ triśūlaṃ śyāmāpāṇḍaraśarīrañ ca
satataṃ vajrakule bhāvitaṃ vajrañ ca gṛhe likhitam arcayet
śrīherukasya kulodbhūtā jñeyā sā vajraḍākinī //18.4//

yasyā śūlaṃ lalāṭena śakti hi cāpadṛśyate
raktākṣā gaurā caiva raktapādakarā tathā //18.5//

chāgale kukkuṭe vāpi ramate bhāvitā sadā
cihnaṃ tasyā gṛhe vajraṃ arccate satataṃ sadā //18.6//

śrīherukakulodbhūtā ḍākinī nātra saṃśayaḥ
yasyā vajraṃ lalāṭe tu kare 'pi hi dṛśyate //18.7//

śyāmā jīmūtasadṛśā nityaṃ lalaṭapaṭṭadhāraṇī
mahāsaubhāgyasampannā sādhvī paratarāś ca yā //18.8//

likhitaṃ ca gṛhe cakraṃ yasyā vai pūjayate sadā
vajravarāhīkulodbhūtā ḍākinī baladarppitā //18.9//

yā ca kṛṣṇāñjanaśyāmā daśanonnatabhāvayā
krūca satataṃ vāmā satvayuktā ca yā bhavet //18.10//

nityaṃ śvānaratā yā ca vācayā na ca bahubhāṣiṇī
vajraṃ gṛhe pūjyate yasyāḥ satataṃ likhitaṃ śubham //18.11//

vajravārāhyākulodbhūtā sahasrāṇi daśapañcakaṃ
gaurī kanakasaṃkāśā tathā \dag rūpikṣīyā\dag ca lomaśā //18.12//

yasyā lalāṭe vajraṅ kare vāpi hi dṛśyate
rājyārūḍhā tu nityaṃ garbhitā satyavādinī mallikāmodagandhinī //18.13//

yasyā gṛhe ca vajraṃ hi satataṃ pūjyate mahat
khaṇḍarohākulodbhūtā mahāyogeśvarīvarā //18.14//

māṃsapriyā ca nityaṃ yā kṛṣāñjanaprabhā
śūlākāraṃ lalāṭaṃ tu kulakarmmaratā cayā //18.15//

śmaśānaṃ jātinityaṃ hi nirbhayā nirghṛṇā ca yā
yasyā lalāṭe śūlaṃ kapālaṃ ca likhitaṃ pūjyate gṛhe
śrīherukadevasya ḍākinī sā kulodbhavā daśanair viṣamaiḥ sthitā //18.16//

satataṃ krūrakarmā vā vāmadaṃṣṭrotkaṭayā
likhitaṃ paraśuṃ yasyā gṛhe nityaṃ ca pūjyate //18.17//

vināyakasya kulodbhūtā ḍākinī sa na saṃśayaḥ
etat ḍākinīgaṇasya śrīherukakulodbhavā
sādhakānāṃ hitārthāya lakṣaṇaṃ samudāhṛtam //18.18//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne sarvayoginīvarṇalakṣaṇacihnavidhipaṭalo 'ṣṭādaśamaḥ


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi lāmānāṃ tu lakṣaṇam
yena samyag vijānīyād bhāvayan sādhakaḥ ... //19.1//

mukhaṃ yasyās tu dṛśyeta ... parimaṇḍalam
vaktre śmaśrūṇi nityaṃ bhruvau dīrghe sulomaśā //19.2//

śuklavastrā śuciḥ saumyā akṣobhyā styavādinī 
saddharmaratā nityaṃ vārabhāginī tu sa jñeyā //19.3//

padmamudrā pradātavyā kūrmamudrāthavā punaḥ
ajinaṃ kamaṇḍaluṃ caiva pratimudrā vidhīyate //19.4//

daśamī parvaṇī tasyāḥ padmaṃ ca likhitaṃ gṛhe
striyānāṃ tu lāmānām etad bhavati lakṣaṇam //19.5//

lamboṣṭhī ca viśālākṣī raktapiṅgalalocanā
āḍhyā ca subhagā dhanyā gaurī campakasaṃnibhā //19.6//

dīrghā dīrghakarālā ca vicitravasanapriyā
tisro lekhā lalāṭe ca ūrdhvasīmantam āśritāḥ //19.7//

hasate ramate caiva mārgam ākramya tiṣṭhati
saṃgrāme mṛtakānāṃ ca kathāsu ramate sadā //19.8//

īdṛśīṃ pramadāṃ dṛṣṭvā śūlamudrāṃ pradāpayet
ākuñcitavāmapādaṃ tu nṛtyaṃ caiva pradarśayet //19.9//

parivartanaṃ ca vāmena pratimudrā vidhīyate 
caturdaśy cāṣṭamī ca parvaṇī tasyā vidhīyate //19.10//

pūjā ca satataṃ tasyāḥ śūlaṃ ca likhitaṃ gṛhe
lokeśvarāṇāṃ tu lāmānām etad bhavati lakṣaṇaṃ //19.11//

nityaṃ hi kūpakau yasyā dṛcyete kapolasaṃsthitau
raktagaurā tathā nityaṃ raktapiṅgalalocanā //19.12//

kuñcitāś ca tathā keśāḥ paṭṭabandhaś ca śire
lalāṭe dṛśyate caiva ekarekhā pratiṣṭhitā //19.13//

dīrghagrīvā tathā cordhvā ......
...... raktavastrapriyā sadā //19.14//

hasate gāyate caiva akasmāc ca prakupyati
calacittā viśeṣeṇa kalaheṣu ca rajyate //19.15//

īdṛśīṃ pramadāṃ dṛṣṭvā śaktimudrāṃ pradarśayet
ghaṇṭāmudrā ca pradātavyā dvitīyā caiva yatnataḥ //19.16//

parivartanaṃ tu vāmena pratimudrā vidhīyate
...... //19.17//

hrasvā caiva sthūlajaṅghā ca ......
pītavastrapriyā nityaṃ skandhavstrāvalambinī //19.18//

īdṛśīṃ pramadāṃ dṛṣṭvā cakramudrāṃ pradāpayet
śaṅkhamudrā pradātavyā dvitīyā caiva yatnataḥ //19.19//

parivartanaṃ vāmena pratimudrā vidhīyate
caturdaśī parvaṇī tasyā vajraṃ ca likhitaṃ gṛhe //19.20//

śrīherukānāṃ ca lāmānām etad bhavati lakṣaṇam
lomaśā sarvagātreṣu kṛṣṇapiṅgalalocanā //19.21//

karālavikṛtā ghorā sthūlāsyā sthūlavaktrajā
lamboṣṭhī kṛṣṇavarṇā ca koṭarākṣī bhagnanāsikā //19.22//

nṛtyagāndharvakuśalā meghavarṇā manoharā
īdṛśīṃ pramadāṃ dṛṣṭvā nāgamudrāṃ pradāpayet //19.23//

śaktimudrā pradātavyā dvitīyāpi hi yatnataḥ
parivartanaṃ ca vāmena pratimudrā vidhīyate //19.24//

ekādaśī parvaṇī tasyā daṃṣṭrā ca likhitā gṛhe
vāhīṇāṃ tu lāmānām etad bhavati lakṣaṇam //19.25//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne sarvayoginyomudrānirdeśavidhipaṭala ūnaviṃśatimaḥ.


athānyatamaṃ vakṣye vāmahastaṃ tu chommakam
yena vijñāyate samyag bhrātā ca bhaginī tathā //20.1//
vāmahastaṃ darśayet yā tu abhivādayāmīty uktaṃ bhavati 
anāmikāṃ darśayed yā tu pratyabhivādanam ity uktaṃ bhavati //20.2//

udaraṃ tāḍayed yā tu bubhukṣitā vayam ity uktaṃ bhvati
lalāṭaṃ darśayet yā tu ākāśād āgatam ity uktaṃ bhavati //20.3//

mukhād aṅguliṃ prakṣiped yā tu bhuñjāmīty uktaṃ bhavati
jihvāṃ lālayed yā tu bhuktāsmīty uktaṃ bhavati //20.4//

jānuṃ spṛśate yā tu śrāntāsmīty uktaṃ bhavati
aṅgulyagraṃ spṛcate yā tu viśrāntāsmīty uktaṃ bhavati //20.5//

dantaṃ kiṭakiṭāyate yā tu bhakṣayāmīty uktaṃ bhavati
bhukuṭīṃ darśayed yā tu baddhāsmīty uktaṃ bhavati //20.6//

garuḍaṃ darśayed yā tu muktāsmīty uktaṃ bhvati
muṣṭiṃ darśayed yā tu paṭṭiśamasyāḥ pradarśayet //20.7//

keśān darśayed yā tu vikṛtaṃ ca nirīkṣayet
nakhaṃ darśayed yā tu khaṭvāṅgaṃ tasyā darśayet //20.8//

aṅgaṃ vidhūnate yā tu dvidaṃṣṭrāṃ tasyā pradarśayet
hastena hastaṃ vādayed yā tu balir bhoktavyam ity uktaṃ bhavati //20.9//

dakṣiṇahastaṃ pradarśayed yā tu evaṃ kuruṣvety uktaṃ bhavati
karṇaṃ spṛśate yā tu vaśitavyam ity uktaṃ bhavati //20.10//

nakhair nakhaṃ spṛśate yā tu mṛtā nīyatety uktaṃ bhavati
bhūmiṃ vilikhate yā tu adya maṇḍalaṃ praviśāmīty uktaṃ bhavati //20.11//

cibukaṃ spṛcate yā tu putro me rakṣitavyam ity uktaṃ bhavati
vāmāṅguṣṭhena bhūmiṃ vilikhate yā tu gurujano me rakṣitavyam ity uktaṃ bhavati //20.12//

akṣiṇī unmīlayed yā tu evaṃ kuruṣveti vaktavyaṃ bhavati
parvaṇī lehayed yā tu sukhaśayanam ity uktaṃ bhavati //20.13//

yāni kānicid dūtīnāṃ tān sarvān pradarśayet //20.14//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne sarvayognyahastamudrāsaṃketavidhipaṭalo viṃśatimaḥ.


atha darśanamahāguhyaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ pravadāmy aham
yā spṛśate śikhāṃ nārī śiras tasyāḥ pradarśayet //21.1//

lalātaṃ darśayed yā tu gaṇḍaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
daśanaṃ darśayed yā tu jihvāṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //21.2//

oṣṭhau darśayed yā tu cibukaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
grīvāṃ spṛśate yā tu udraṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //21.3//

hastau darśayed yā tu bāhuṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
trikaṭikāṃ darśayet yā tu pṛthivīṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //21.4//

stanau darśayed yā tu cibukaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
udaraṃ darśayed yā tu nābhiṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //21.5//

guhyaṃ darśayed yā tu liṅgaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
ūruṃ darśayet yā tu apānaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //21.6//

jānuṃ darśayed yā tu jaṅghāṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet 
pādau darśayed yā tu talaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //21.7//

aṅguliṃ darśayed yā tu nakhaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
bhūmiṃ pradarśayed yā tu ākāśaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //21.8//

ākāśaṃ darśayed yā tu sūryaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
nadīṃ pradarśayed yā tu samudraṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //21.9//

etā aṅgamudrā ḍākinīnāṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ
ebhis tu darśayen nityaṃ samyag darśanaṃ yānti guhyakāḥ //21.10//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne darśanāṅgamudrālakṣaṇavidhipaṭala ekaviṃśatimaḥ.


ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi aṅgamudrāṃ yathāvidhi
yena vijñāyate bhrātā bhaginī vā viśeṣataḥ //22.1//

ekāṅguliṃ darśayed yātu svāgata[m ity uktaṃ ] bhavati
dvyaṅguliṃ darśayed yā tu susvāgatam ity uktaṃ bhavati //22.2//

etāḥ sarvayoginyo 'ṅgamudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ
netramudrāṃ vijānīyād dvābhyām aṅgulisūcyaṃ tu //22.3//

kiñcit kuñcitatarjanīṃ mantrī darśayet tu tām
tatkṣaṇād vaśam āyāti yāvajjīvaṃ tu guhyaka //22.4//

mudrā potaṅginīnāma yāvajjīvaṃ na saṃśayaḥ
madhyamāṃ darśayed yā tu pradeśinīṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //22.5//

anāmikāṃ pradarśayed yā tu jihvāṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
paṭṭiśaṃ darśayed yā tu śūlaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //22.6//

śiro darśayed yā tu medinīṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
mahīṃ darśayed yā tu ākāśaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //22.7//

bhukuṭiṃ darśayed yā tu sīmāntaṃ tasyā darśayet
dantān darśayed yā tu oṣṭhaṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //22.8//

grīvāṃ darśayed yā tu vaktraṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet
lalātaṃ darśayed vā tu dṛṣṭiṃ tasyāḥ pradarśayet //22.9//

etāḥ sarvayoginyaḥ kramād aṅgamudrā pracoditā
ebhis tu darśayet samyag darśanaṃ yānti guhyakāḥ //22.10//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne viśeṣamudrālakṣaṇavidhipaṭalo dvāviṃśatimaḥ

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi ḍākinīnāṃ tu lakṣaṇam
jñāyate 'dūrato yena vīrāṇāṃ vīrabhaginī //23.1//

