tathaiva tena ca tasyā vajrākṛtir iva sphuṭam
svaraḥ koṭiladhvanirvyaktaṃ tasyāḥ sadaivahi //23.6//

gṛhe cāsyā bhavec cihnaṃ vajrākāraṃ tu darpaṇam
aparākṛtis tu khaḍgākāraṃ sadarpaṇam //23.7//

dhvajaśaktir jñāyate nityaṃ saṃpuṭaṃ darpaṇena ca
etāni jñeyacihnāni kṛtarūpo hi sūkṣmataḥ //23.8//

ebhis tu lakṣaṇair yuktā vijñeyā paramaḍākinī //23.9//

