athānyatamaṃ vakṣye prastāraṃ durlabham
yena vijñātamātreṇāśu siddhiḥ prasādhakaḥ //30.1//

bhūmibhāge same ramye candanenopalipya ca
sugandhagandhamṛdite puṣparakarasaṅkule //30.2//

dīpamālāsamākīrṇe dhūpāmodamanorame 
sakalīkṛtya cātmānaṃ diśābandhaṃ tu kārayet //30.3//

murajabandhaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā navarekhā tu vartulam
varṇamātraṃ samālikhya prastaret susamāhitaḥ //30.4//

tatrastham uddhared vīraṃ sarvakāmārthasādhakam
anulomavilomena svaravarṇāṃś ca sādhakaḥ //30.5//

etatsaṃkhyāntargataṃ kārayet kuśalaṃ muneḥ
koṣṭhadvātriṃśati saṃgṛhya pañcamena bheditam //30.6//

śatārthārdhaṃ samādāya caturviṃśatibheditam
koṣṭhaṣaṭtriṃśatimaṃ koṣṭhatrayeṇa bheditam //30.7//

dvātriṃśat tato gṛhya pañcamena tu bheditam
pañcaviṃśat tato gṛhya caturviṃśati yojayet //30.8//

trayastriṃśa samādāya koṣṭhapañcadaśārcitam
pañcamena samāyuktaṃ śobhanaṃ paramaṃ matam //30.9//

dvāviṃśatisamāyuktaṃ saptaviṃśatim eva ca
etat sarvaṃ samādāya prathamaṃ padam ucyate //30.10//

koṣṭhakād ekonaviṃśatimaṃ vahniputreṇa samāyuktam
koṣṭhatritayena bheditaṃ sākṣaraṃ bhavet //30.11//

yavargāc cāṣṭamaṃ bījaṃ koṣṭhaṣaṭtriṃśena samāyutam
punar evaṃ padañ caiva sarvakāmārthasādhakaḥ //30.12//

svayaṃbhūṃ tato gṛhya koṣṭhāt pañcamasaṃyutam
bindunā ūrdhvabhūṣitam //30.13//

sarvārthasādhakaṃ nāma dvitīyaṃ padam ucyate
ekonaviṃśatikoṣṭhaṃ tu saptaviṃśena bheditam //30.14//

tṛtīyena tu saṃyuktaṃ trayastriṃśat samādāya koṣṭhadvitīyena tu
viṃśakena samāyuktaṃ śobhanaṃ paramaṃ hitam //30.15//

ekaviṃśatikoṣṭhaṃ tu tathā ṣaḍviṃśasaṃyutam
dvir abhyāsapadaṃ caiva uddharet susamāhitaḥ //30.16//

vilomena tato gṛhya koṣṭhakāt prathamaṃ ca vai
caturthāntena saṃyuktaṃ tathā pañcadaśārcitam //30.17//

dharmārthamokṣakāmānāṃ tṛtīyaṃ padam ucyate
koṣṭhakād dvitīyaṃ bījaṃ tu ṣaṭtriṃśatikoṣṭhakāt //30.18//

tathā ṣaḍviṃśam eva ca caturthaṃ padam ucyate
trayastriṃśaṃ samādāya koṣṭhatrayodaśārcitam //30.19//

koṣṭhakād daśamaṃ caiva vilomena tu sādhakaḥ
akārādhiṣṭhitāt koṣṭhād ekonaviṃśatimaṃ tathā //30.20//

kakārādhiṣṭhitāt koṣṭhāt trayodaviṃśati koṣṭhakāt
dvitīyakoṣṭhasaṃyuktaṃ bindunā ūrdhvabhūṣitam //30.21//

pārthivaṃ tu tato gṛhya aṣṭamaṃ tu punas tathā
agninā bhedayed dhīmān hūṃphaṭkārāntayojitā //30.22//

etat trailokyavijayaṃ nāma mantraṃ padaiś caturbhir bhūṣitam
oṃkāradīpakāḥ sarve hūṃphaṭkārāntayojitā //30.23//

vidyārājacakravartimantro 'yaṃ na bhūto na bhaviṣyati
tattvasaṃgrahe paramādye saṃvare vajrabhairave //30.24//

catuḥkrodhasamāyuktam aṣṭamūrtisamanvitam
maṇḍalaṃ tasya rakṣārthaṃ sarvaduṣṭaviśeṣataḥ //30.25//

anena labdhamātreṇa miryate hy avicāraṇāt
cakrayogāt samuccārya sarvasiddhiphalodayam //30.26//

oṃ sumbha nisumbha hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ phaṭ.
oṃ grihṇa grihṇa hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ.
oṃ grihṇāpaya grihṇāpaya hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ.
oṃ ānaya ho bhagavāṃ vajra hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ. //30.27//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne murajabandhamantroddhāravidhipaṭalas triṃśatimaḥ.


tataḥ
mahāmāṃsena sarveṣāṃ nāśanaṃ vajrajaṃ smṛtam
etat sarvakrūrāṇāṃ nāśako dāruṇas tathā //31.1//

evaṃ śvānaśūkaramāṃsānāṃ tāmracūḍānāṃ tathaiva ca
bhakṣyahomabalikriyā kartavyā 'vicārataḥ //31.2//

siddhyaty aśeṣaniḥśeṣasarvarājyaṃ prasiddhyati
śaṅkhaśuktikamuktānāṃ trayo nimittasambhavāḥ //31.3//

dharmajñānaśarīrāṇāṃ kapālaṃ kena dūṣyate
kapālamālinaṃ vīraṃ candrārdhakṛtabhūṣaṇam //31.4//

evam eva hi vīrāṇāṃ vīrajaṃ smṛtam
chommakān darśayet pañcavāmahastaṃ tu sādhakaḥ //31.5//

vīrāṇām ālayo hy eṣa chommakānāṃ pravartanam
vāmodhbavaṃ jagat sarvaṃ trailokyaṃ sacarācaram //31.6//

vajrasattvas tanave sthitaḥ latāyāṃ vairocanas tathā
evam eva bhavet tatra gurave padmanartakaḥ //31.7//

dhārāyāṃ sthitaḥ vīraḥ sarvasiddhipradāyakaḥ
kaniṣṭhāyām ākāśagarbha tanur avyayaḥ //31.8//

nakheṣu ca hayagrīva[s tathā caivokta]m ālayam
ete sarvavīrāṇāṃ vāmasambhavakāraṇam //31.9//

hastatale śrīherukavajravārāhīsamāgamotsukaḥ
pṛṣṭhe tu sarvaḍākinyo darśayed ātmapañcakam //31.10//

karanyāsaṃ bhaved etat sarvapriyasamāgamam
evaṃ vidhividhānena pūjayed vīram uttamam //31.11//

pṛthivī locanā khyātā abdhātur māmakī smṛtā
tejaḥ pāṇḍarā khyātā vāyus tārā prakīrtitā //31.12//

cumbikā śūnye tu evaṃ pāramitās tathā
madhye tu sarvavīrālayaṃ pṛṣṭhe tu visarjayed budhaḥ //31.13//

aprakāśyam idaṃ guhyaṃ gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ
evaṃ chommayed vīraṃ ekam eva carum ārabhet
sarvavīrasamāyogaḍākinījālasaṃvaram //31.14//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne bhakṣyahomabalikriyāhastachomāvidhipaṭala ekatriṃśatimaḥ


ataḥ paraṃ samākhyātaṃ bhakṣyabhojanamelakam
yena samyag vidhānena āśu siddhiḥ pravartate //32.1//

paśūnāṃ karṣaṇaṃ caiva pūrvoktakramasādhakaḥ
paśavaś ca tathā pañca kharamānuṣakūrmoṣṭraśṛgālahayādibhiḥ //32.2//

ete paśuprasiddhyaṅgā siddhisādhanam eva ca
varṇānāṃ brāhmaṇaḥ paśuś catuṣpādānāṃ hastir ucyate //32.3//

pakṣiṇāṃ haṃsa eva ca tiryagaṇāṃ kacchapanirjitaḥ
devānāṃ mukhacālanaṃ nānārūpeṇa kathyate //32.4//

ete paśusamākhyātāḥ siddhisādhanamaṇḍalam
kākabakajambukadvijamahāmantrikrauñcasārasakādambakāḥ //32.5//

bhaṣyahomabalikriyāsiddhir bhavati kāminī
kṛṣṇaśunīpayasā kṛṣṇamāṣataṇḍulānvitam //32.6//

śavavakre tu mantreṇa juhuyād aviśaṅkitaḥ
śatam aṣṭottaraṃ yāvat hotavyaṃ sādhakottamaiḥ //32.7//

tata uttiṣṭhate pretaḥ kiṅkaro 'ham iti cābravīt
pātālottiṣṭhakhaḍgaṃ ca grahanigraham eva ca //32.8//

gulikāñjananidhānaṃ vā pādalepo rasāyanam
dattvā aikāṃ [tathā siddhiṃ tato] gacchati nānyathā //32.9//

adhordhvadūtayaḥ siddhā asmiṃs tantre na saṃśayaḥ
goṣṭhopalikāś caiva śeṣāḥ śuṣkaśirās tataḥ //32.10//

mahāśaṅkamayaṃ kuryād abhedyaṃ kacchapasya tu
etac caivākṣasūtraṃ tu siddhiṃ yacchaty anuttamām //32.11//

caturbhujaṃ caturvaktraṃ yāval lakṣabhujaṃ tathā
sitadehaṃ mahograṃ ca bhairavākāram eva ca //32.12//

nirīkṣayan tu vajravārāhīṃ tadvarṇāyudhadhāriṇīm
kapālamālinaṃ vīraṃ bhasmagātrāvalepanam //32.13//

mudrādibhūṣitagātraṃ tu jaṭāmakuṭāṅkaśūlinam
īṣad daṃṣṭrākarālāsyaṃ mahāpretakṛtāsanam //32.14//

tato jñātvā vidhivad yogī bhāvayet sarvadevatām
sadākālaṃ tu sādhakaḥ
evaṃ guṇaviśiṣṭānām siddhir bhavati kāminī //32.15//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne tiryakpaśuvetālasādhanotpattikramavidhipaṭalo dvātriṃśatimaḥ

ataḥ paraṃ nāsti sarvaḥ sarvayogeṣu sādhakaḥ
bhakṣyabhojyamatsyamāṃsādibhiḥ kartavyo yathāśaktitaḥ //33.1//

avidyamāne 'pi kartavyaṃ pañcakhādyādiyatnataḥ
rātrau tu sadā kuryāt bhakṣyabhojanavistaram //33.2//

dūtī ca tato 'dyāt viśeṣeṇa tu sādhakaḥ
svāṅge śiraḥ kṛtvā vīrādvayaprapūjitam //33.3//

mātā vā yadi vā bhoaginī putrī vā bāndhavī bhāryā vai
evaṃ vidhividhānena kuryād bandhabandhanamuktakam //33.4//

tataḥ sidhyante mantrā yāvad āhutasaṃplavaḥ
ācāryamūrtim ādhāya pūjāṃ gṛhṇāmi sādhakaḥ //33.5//

vīrāṇām āsanaṃ caiva mudrām eva na saṃśayaḥ
gītanṛtyādi kartavyaṃ sādhakaḥ susamāhitaḥ //33.6//

yāvad bhramanti saṃsāre duḥkhaśokapariplutāḥ
na bhavanti ca yogajñā tāvat sarve 'pi dehinaḥ //33.7//

pūjayet tato mudrāṃ sarvabhāvena sādhakaḥ
pūjitāḥ pūjyam icchānti nirdahanty apamānitāḥ //33.8//

ādisiddhā mahāmudrā yogatantreṣu mānavaḥ
suyatnataḥ pūjanīyāḥ paścād vīravīrātvam ācaret //33.9//

evaṃ pūjāṃ tataḥ kṛtvā pātālottiṣṭhasādhakaḥ
śātipuṣṭivaśyākarṣaṇamāraṇoccāṭanādikam //33.10//

jambhanaṃ stambhanaṃ caiva vidveṣe nigrahe tathā
pūjayet karmasiddhiṃ tu ākleśena tu siddhyati //33.11//

sarvakarmeṣu yat kiñcit sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ //33.12//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne guhyapūjāsatkāravidhipaṭalas trayastriṃśattamaḥ.

atha ḍākinyajālasya cakrākhyaṃ vidhivistaram
yasmin karmaṇi sā kṣipraṃ sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ //34.1//

sarvavīraḍākinyaḥ puṣkareṣu niyojayet
nikṣipeta bhruvor madhye avadhūtīpadaṃ tathā //34.2//

vīrocchuṣmamukhenāgnau nānyaṃ juhuyāt tataḥ
gomāṃṣarudhireṇāśu pañcāhutas tathā //34.3//

tato navāhutīr dadyāt jvalite ca hutāśane 
jvālāmālārṇavaṃ paśyec cakraṃ vai sarvatomukham //34.4//

caturvaktraṃ tu vīreśaṃ vīravīrālayaṃ tathā
dale dūtyaś ca catvāri cakravīrādvayaṃ sukham //34.5//

yathā vidhyākāreṇa khaṇḍarohāṃ bāhyato dadyāt
svarūpair viniviṣṭāṃ tu cakramadhye tu darśayet //34.6//

eṣa te cakranirdiṣṭaṃ sarvasiddhipradāyakam
cakrodbhāsaṃ tathā kuryād yathākarmānurūpataḥ //34.7//

vidyārṇave yathā vīre samāsāt paribhāṣitam
dūtyādvayayogena siddhyante nātra saṃśayaḥ //34.8//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne advayadūtyahomākarṣanavidhipaṭalaś catustriṃśatimaḥ

atha karmavaraṃ śreṣṭhaṃ yathānukramalakṣitam
pūjādvayayogātmā pratikarmasuyojitā //35.1//

yo prasiddhikarā mantrā bhedās teṣāṃ yathākramam
varṇadūtyādi tanmantraṃ śaravega paribhramet //35.2//

anyonyaghaṭitā mantrāḥ praveśena tu bheditāḥ
bījamālāṃ tato grastāṃ hūṃkārāntaḥpraiṣṭhitām //35.3//

nirodhāt tu bhavet sādhyaṃ padam ekaṃ na gacchati
sampuṭaṃ sampuṭībhāvena vajraśṛṅkhalabandhena //35.4//

vajreṇa bhedayec caiva picchakaṃ bhrāmayet tataḥ
ākarṣayed aṅkuśeṇeva kṣobhaṇe muṣalaṃ tathā //35.5//

aśane vajram evoktaṃ bandhane śarayojitam
kālamṛtyuvañcanaṃ caiva aṅge khaṭvāṅgayojitam //35.6//

kapālārghapātraṃ tu vaktre astraniyojitam //35.7//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne advayakarmakālamṛtyuvañcanavidhipaṭalaḥ pañcatriṃṣatimaḥ

atha mudrā mahāpūjā mantranyāsaprakīrtitā
āśusiddhikarā hy ete mudrā pūjā na saṃśayaḥ //36.1//

mantraṃ saṃyojya dvau liṅge ḍākinyavīram advayam
ḍākinīnāṃ yojanaṃ mantrī hṛdayābhis tathaiva ca //36.2//

yoginīṃ manthayed dhīmān śuddhakāyo yathepsitam
vīrapūjā 'dvayaṃ jñātvā karma kurvīta yatnataḥ //36.3//

vibhajya svecchayā mantrī viparītāṃ tu yojayet
nigrahānugrahārtheṣu karmabhāvaṃ prabhāvayet //36.4//

bheditā tattvabhedena nāḍimārgeṣu yojitāḥ
prasādhayet prayogārthaṃ bāhyābhyantaraṃ tathā //36.5//

anena sādhayet kṣipraṃ sadevāsuramānuṣān //36.6//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne tattvapūjākarṣaṇavidhipaṭalaḥ ṣaṭtriṃśatimaḥ.

athānyatamaṃ pravakṣyāmi vigrahākrāntasādhanam
anyonyavalitā mantrā ḍākinyaś caikatra yojitāḥ //37.1//

bhuktam udgīrṇaṃ bhojyaṃ tu japāntena tu chardayet
tataḥ pūrṇasaptarātreṇa khādanādiṣu yojayet //37.2//

anena vaśam āyānti yāvajjīvaṃ na saṃśayaḥ
kapilāyā ghṛtaṃ pītvā japāntena tu chardayet //37.3//

tatas tenātmānaṃ mukham abhyaṅgayet tataḥ
yadi kruddho bhaven nityaṃ darśayed vaśam ānayet //37.4//

abhaṅgya tilatailais tu śālipiṣṭakasamanvitam
kṛtvā śaṃkulikāṃ mantrī bhakṣaṇena prayojayet //37.5//

yāvajjīvaṃ sadā vaśyaṃ yadi karma na muñcati
bhakṣayitvā tilān kṛṣṇāṃś charditān rājikaiḥ saha //37.6//

kuṣṭhaṃ cāpānayuktaṃ tu karajodarakīṭakam
pīṣayed ātmaraktena śukreṇaiva tu bhāvayet //37.7//

khānapānāñjanair vastrair lepaṃ caiva prayojayet
vaśīkaraṇam evaṃ tu yāvajjīvaṃ na saṃśayaḥ //37.8//

gomāṃsāhutayo homas tadraktabhyaktadevatāḥ
tatkṣaṇād vaśam āyāti mriyate yadi nāgacchati //37.9//

māṃsaṃ tasyāgrato dhyātvā homayec ca cicakṣaṇaḥ
homānte ca baliṃ dattvā dattvā trailokyam ākarṣayet kṣaṇāt
saptarātreṇa siddhiḥ syāt //37.10//

durlabhaṃ triṣu lokeṣu samayācāralakṣaṇam
gopanīyaṃ prayatnena gūḍhamantraiḥ sadā svayam //37.11//

na ca labhate gūḍhārthaṃ mandabhāgyo na siddhyati
sādhakair alpapuṇyaiś ca mayā tuṣṭena labhyate //37.12//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne adhyātmavaśyādhikāravidhipaṭalaḥ saptatriṃśatimaḥ.


tataḥ chommakāni tu ḍāinīnāṃ śarīrasya tu lakṣaṇam
vīrāṅgabhedaṃ tathaiva ca yat sādhyaṃ siddhim eva tat //38.1//

na ca likhati vīreśvaro na paṭhet kasyacid agrataḥ
gopayet sarvākāreṇa vāmācārasugopitam //38.2//

pramādāt paṭhate mantrī guhyalakṣaṇaḍākinīḥ
nāhaṃ tasya paśyāmi ḍākinīsahasram anekadhā
bhakṣyaṃ na so durātmakaḥ //38.3//

samayaghno durācāro brahmaghnaś ca na saṃśayaḥ
pāpācāro mūḍho vañcito 'sau durātmakaḥ //38.4//

nāhaṃ tasya paritrātā bhakṣyamāṇasya yoginībhiḥ
guhyakānāṃ madhye tu paśur eva sa sādhakaḥ //38.5//

patito 'sau buddhalokād gurudrohaḥ samayadrohakaḥ
yas tu pālayate tantraṃ śrīherukaghoradarśanam //38.6//

tasyāham anugrāhī ḍākinīsārdhaṃ śubhānanam
guavaś cānumanyanti gūhayanti ca sādhakāḥ //38.7//

yoginīnāṃ priyo nityaṃ siddhis tasya na saṃśayaḥ
sādhako vīratāṃ yāti trailokye khecarādhipaḥ //38.8//

pūjyo bhavati sarvatra sādhako vīrakāṅkiṣiṇaḥ
yogas tasya pravartate sampradāyaṃ ca vindati //38.9//

ācāryaṃ tu vīraṃ dṛṣṭvā śrīherukavratadhāriṇam
dṛṣṭvā dṛṣṭvaiva saṃhṛṣya mantreṇānena sādhakaḥ //38.10//

mūlamantraparam vīraṃ saptavārān uccāret
praṇavahūṃkārabheditam ...... //38.11//

teṣāṃ praṇamya yatnena sarvabuddhādipūjitam
nityam eva mahāvīraṃ krīḍāyukto na saṃśayaḥ //38.12//

teṣāṃ hṛdisthā vārāhī vīrayoginyadvayasthitam
tena tasya sujanmanaḥ prāṇinaḥ puṇyadarśanāt //38.13//

nadītaṭasamudreṣu parvateṣu catuṣpathe 
taḍāgakūpapuṣkariṇīśūnyālayapratoliṣu //38.14//

evaṃ saṃraktanayanā sthitā sarvatra ḍākinyaḥ
mahābhairavaśmaśāne ca pātāle khecarī tathā //38.15//

vetālair apy anekais tair bhīṣaṇaiś ca mahābalaiḥ
etaiḥ sārdhaṃ mahāvīraḥ krīḍate ca yathāsukham //38.16//

kuhare gahvare guhye gūḍhamānuṣyayoginī
tattatsthānapradeśeṣu krīḍate sādhakena tu //38.17//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne yoginīsthānapradeśaguhyavīrālayavidhipaṭalo 'ṣṭaviṃśatimaḥ


atha mahāsiddhiyogī hāsamantram aṣṭavidham
tataḥ saṃdarśayan tasmai pradadāti na saṃśayaḥ //39.1//

ghoreṇa bahuśabdena ḍākinyaś ca bhayaṅkarāḥ
tena śrutena taṃ vīraṃ trasanti vidravanti ca //39.2//

na bhīyate yadi vīraḥ ḍākinīsārdham eva ca
tābhir vāmakare guhya nīyate svapuraṃ tataḥ //39.3//

śrīherukaśaktikāmena nīyate khecarīadam
tatrābhirato nityaṃ gamiṣyati sukhāvatīm //39.4//

na jarāmṛtyuḥ sarvatra sādhako mantravigrahaḥ //39.5//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne darśanāṭṭahāsavidhipaṭala ūnacālīśatimaḥ


tataḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi yena martyaṃ vaśaṃ nayet
māsena sidhyate vīraṃ mantrayogavidhisthitam //40.1//

piśitaṃ sonmattakena matsyamāṃsena saṃyutam
sarvāvastho 'pi vīreśaḥ saptāhāt sādhakasya ca //40.2//

mahāsiddhiṃ pradadāti niśihomaparāyaṇaḥ
aṣṭottaraśatenaiva trisandhyaṃ sādhayed yadi //40.3//

sasainyaṃ nṛpatiṃ vaśyaṃ ardhena tu vīramantriṇam
mantriṇaṃ tadardhena saptāhād vaśam ānayet //40.4//

sāmantānāṃ dvātriṃśad homayed āhutikramāt
brāhmaṇaṃ viṃśatir eva saptāhena tu homayet //40.5//

evaṃ kṣatriyaṃ tu sapta vaiśyaṃ ca pañca homayet
śūdre tu trayam eva syād ekaṃ juhuyāt tu antyaje //40.6//

ekamāsanam āśrityaivaṃ vīraḥ kulakramāt
ākarṣayet sarvasattvān mantraśaktyā tu sādhakaḥ //40.7//

evaṃ kurvan martyavīraḥ kāmaṃ vidhipūrvakam
sevayan devatāyogaṃ bhadrakalpam avapnuyāt //40.8//

ḍākinīnāṃ manojñaḥ syāt sādhako nātra saṃśayaḥ //40.9//
 
iti śrīherukābhidhāne pañcavarṇavaśīkaraṇamahāmudrāsevanavidhipaṭalaḥ cālīśatimaḥ

athakarmavaraṃ śreṣṭhaṃ yena jānanti
vaśyākarṣaṇavidveṣamāraṇoccāṭanādikam //41.1//

jṛmbhaṇam stambhanam caiva mohanaṃ kīlanaṃ ca vai
vācopaharaṇaṃ mūkabadhiramandhatā tathā //41.2//

ṣaṇḍhatvakaraṇaṃ cāpi rūpa[sya] parivartanam
dvādaśaitan mahākarma sādhakaḥ sādhayet sadā //41.3//

siddhiḥ smaraṇamātreṇa sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ
sarvottareṣu ḍākinya pīṭhādi tu sarvavyāpinī //41.4//

svayoniṣu jñānayuktā deśe deśe 'bhijātakāḥ
ḍākinyaḥ kathitās tās tu vajramaṇḍalanāyikāḥ //41.5//

suvarṇadvīpe saurāṣṭre tathā ca gṛhadevā
pretapuryāṃ himālaye kāñcyāṃ lampākaviṣye
kaliṅge caiva kosale ... //41.6//

trisakunis tathā oḍre kāmarūpe ca mālave
devīkoṭṭe rāmeśvare godāvaryāṃ tathārbude
oḍḍiyānajālandharapullīramalayādiṣu //41.7//

eteṣu deśeṣu kanyā yāḥ vīrādvayayoginī
sarvās tāḥ kāmarūpiṇyo manovegānuvṛttayaḥ
ṣaḍ yoginyaḥ kulatāyāṃ marudeśe ca mātarāḥ //41.8//

sindhudeśe ca lāmās tu nagare kulanāyikāḥ
lampāke ...... saurāṣṭe kuladevatāḥ //41.9//

pretapuryāṃ mahākālyo ḍākinī saha rūpiṇī
... himagirau kāṃ ucyāṃ sabālikāḥ prakīrtitāḥ 
pañcālaviṣaye caiva tathā ca gṛhadevatā //41.10//

kaliṅge vratadhāariṇyaḥ kośale piśitāśanāḥ
pretapuryāṃ tathā caiva vajraḍākyaḥ sthaleśvare //41.11//


atha karmavaram śreṣṭhaṃ vāksiddhiprasādhakam
karavīraraktapuṣpāṇi śatam aṣṭottarāṇi ca
saṃgṛhya gāvīkṣīreṇa śatajaptaṃ tu kārayet //45.1//

sakṛj japtena puṣpeṇa liṅgamūrdhni tu tāḍayet
evaṃ dine dine kuryāt saptāhaṃ susamāhitaḥ //45.2//

tatas tv ekādaśe divase gṛhyatāṃ kusumāni tu
mahānadyāṃ tu vai gatvā ekaikaṃ tu pravāhayet //45.3//

sarvāṃs tān anupūrveṇa sakṛj japtaṃ prayojayet
nadyāṃ paścimapuṣpaṃ tu pratisrotaṃ pravāhitam //45.4//

taṃ gṛhyodakena saṃyuktaṃ dantair na saṃspṛśet pibet
vācā siddhas tu sādhako guhyatantre  vinirgatam //45.5//

yoginīyogamudrāṃ baddhvā śatam aṣṭottaraṃ japet
sādhyasyābhimukho mantrī sādhyasyaivodare sthitam //45.6//

kaniṣṭhikāṃ cālayed dhīmān trisandhyaṃ tanmanaḥsthitaḥ
brahmaghno 'pi saptāhāt śakrādivaśam ānayet //45.7//

sādhyapratikṛtiṃ kṛtvā raktacandanadhūlinā
trikaṭukena liṅgāṅgaṃ sikthakena pralepitam //45.8//

tāmrasūcyā tu tāṃ biddhvā guhyasthāne tu sādhakaḥ
nirdhūmair khadirāṅgārais tāpayet saptāhād budhaḥ //45.9//

japtena śatāntebhiḥ nṛpatiḥ samāntaḥ sapurohitaḥ
antaḥpuraṃ saparivāraṃ drutam ākarṣayet tataḥ //45.10//

nṛpateḥ saparivāraṃ bhūrjapatre tu lekhayet
pretālaktakarocanayā likhen nāma vidarbhitam //45.11//

yasyābhimukho japet khadirānalena pratāpayet
pretālaye prasiddhyarthaṃ tāpayed yāvat sikthakaṃ na līyeta //45.12//

tāpyamānaṃ tu rājānaṃ sa cakravartinām ākarṣayati
pādadhūliṃ tu sādhyasya raktacandanam eva ca //45.13//

śmaśānotsṛṣṭaṃ bhasma ekīkṛtya tu sādhakaḥ
nirdhūmaiḥ khadirāṅgāraiḥ tāpayec ca prayatnataḥ //45.14//

karadvayena tāṃ dhūliṃ nirmathya homayet
siddhiṃ yāvad homitvaṃ gṛhītvā dhūlim eva hi //45.15//

śvāsaṃ nirudhya nikṣiptāṃ tāṃ tatra nikhaned dhruvam
mūrcchitā cetanarahitā kliṣṭā caiva vimohitā //45.16//

āgacchati vāyuvegena nipatati sādhakopari
paśuṃ vā yadi vā dūtīṃ kārayed vibhajed budhaḥ //45.17//

tato vai kārayet karma dūtīgrahaṇam eva ca
karavīralatāṃ gṛhya sādrāṃ bāhupramāṇataḥ //45.18//

yasya mantrābhisaṃlikhya karmakasya tu sādhakaḥ
jvalamāne 'pi cityagnau kṣipet caiva latāṃ punaḥ //45.19//

sa tvaritaṃ tato gṛhya yāvat sā na dahyate
vidyayā saptajaptaṃ tu yam anusmṛtya bhrāmayet //45.20//

tatkṣaṇāt vāyuvegenāgacchati svarūpiṇī
karavīraraktapuṣpaṃ tu śatajaptaṃ puṣyayogeṇa sādhakaḥ //45.21//

gorocanayā viliptaṃ puṣpaṃ udakena saṃsthitam
avatīrya mahānadyāṃ nābhimātrajale sthitam //45.22//

karasaṃpuṭamadhyasthaṃ sahasrajaptaṃ ca vidyayā
karadvayena sampūrṇajalena sahitaṃ pibet //45.23//

tatas tasya bhavet siddhir vācāsiddhis tu sādhakaḥ
rājānaṃ rājapatnīṃ vā manasākarṣayed dhruvam //45.24//

vaśaṃ ca kurute kṣipraṃ sa devāsuramānuṣān
vācayā mārayet kruddho asyoccāṭanam eva ca //45.25//

nigrahaṃ kurute vācā evam eveti sādhakaḥ
stambhayen nadīṃ śakaṭaṃ yantraṃ vācāmātreṇa sāgaram //45.26//

gajavājitathāmeghān puruṣaṃ vātha pakṣiṇam
vācayā kurute sarvā manasā yan manepsitam //45.27//

ākarṣaṇaprayogaṃ tu sarvastrīmohakārakām
raktakusumaṃ tu saṃgṛhya karavīrasya saṃharet //45.28//

vidyayā saptajaptasya yonimadhye nidhāpayet
saṃpuṭīkṛtya taṃ puṣpaṃ guhyasthāne niyojayet //45.29//

śatam ekaṃ japen mantrī advayajñānayogavān
taiḥ puṣpair yonimadhyasthair gṛhyam ekaṃ tu sādhakaḥ //45.30//

yaṃ tāḍayati puṣpeṇa tatkṣaṇāt sa vaśībhavet
vihvalācetanarahitā paravaśā sarvāṅgasandhiṣu //45.31//

vaśaṃ ca kurute kṣipraṃ pratyayaś cen nivartate
etatpratyayasiddhis tu amoghavaśakārakaḥ //45.32//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne ṣaḍyoginīnāṃ karmavāksiddhyākarṣaṇavidhipaṭalaḥ pañcālīśatimaḥ


atha hakārapañcakasya sarvakarmaprasādhakaḥ
yena vijñātamātreṇāśu siddhiḥ pravartate //46.1//

hā hī hai hau haḥ pañcahakārahastau tu saṃmardayet
codanānvitasya mukhenāpi rudhiraṃ vahati tatkṣaṇād eva mārayed ripum //46.2//

śvaśoṇitaṃ kapālasthan anāmikārudhireṇa mardayet
yāvat śeṣam āyāti tataḥ sādhyo vinaśyati //46.3//

yadi kruddho dīptena japet saṃraktalocanaḥ
rājānaṃ mārayaty āśu sasainyabalavāhanam //46.4//

mārjāranakuloebhyaśvānakākabakajambukaḍākinībali homayet
āśu siddhikarā hy ete asmin tantre na saṃśayaḥ //46.5//

śaśakādīnāṃ romāṇi rajjuṃ kṛtvā sahasrābhimantrya
yasya gale badhnāti sa tādṛśo bhavati //46.6//

hastaṃ sahasrābhimantritaṃ kṛtvā karavīrakusumair ekaikākṣaraṃ saṃyojya gurviṇīṃ saṃspṛśet.
garbhaḥ saṃkrāmayati mukte mokṣaḥ.
yaṃ tarjayati taṃ mārayati punar vīvāpayati. //46.7//

iti śrīherukābhidhāne pañcahakārakarmavidhipaṭalaḥ ṣaṭcālīśatimaḥ
